+
+## 2. Order service rules
+
+- [x] 2.1 Extend `OrderService` with `applyCoupon(id, rawCode)`: normalize the code (trim + uppercase), run the checks in the mandated order against the order and coupon, compute `FIXED`/`PERCENT`/capped discount and `finalAmount = amount - discount` using the injected `Clock`, call `redeem`, and return the reloaded order; verify `npm run build` passes.
