+- [x] 2.3 Add service tests for each rejection (invalid body, unknown order, non-pending order, already applied, unknown coupon, inactive, not-yet-valid, expired, usage exhausted, below minimum) asserting the exact code/status, and that the order, `usedCount`, and redemption rows are unchanged; verify they pass.
+
+## 3. HTTP route and wiring
+
