+- [x] 3.2 Add `app.request(...)` integration tests in `tests/applyCoupon.test.ts` asserting the 200 response equals a subsequent `GET /orders/:id` (AC-14/REQ-14) and that `GET /coupons/:code` reports `usedCount + 1` with one redemption row (AC-09); verify they pass.
+
+## 4. Verification
+
+- [x] 4.1 Run `npm run build` and confirm no type errors.
+- [x] 4.2 Run `npm test` and confirm the existing suite plus the new tests pass.
